{
 "uid": "aead-results",
 "title": "Results: AES-GCM envelope vs TLS-only",
 "tags": [
  "aead-study"
 ],
 "timezone": "utc",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "editable": true,
 "refresh": "",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-6h",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 3
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Statistical results** from `analysis/stats.py` (pre-specified in docs/research-design.md \u00a75): the unit of analysis is one run; aead and plain are paired within randomized blocks. Ratio = geometric mean of aead/plain over blocks with a paired-t 95% CI; *p_holm* is Holm-adjusted within the metric family. Per-run values are exact k6 percentiles over all measured requests. Closed loop (`c<VUs>`) and open loop (`a<rate>`) are separate experiments and are never pooled."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "bargauge",
   "title": "Effect of AES-GCM envelope: % change aead vs plain ($metric)",
   "description": "Point estimate of (geometric-mean ratio \u2212 1) \u00d7 100 per cell. See the table for CIs and p-values.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 3,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 9
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "sort_by_label(last_over_time(bench_effect{dataset=~\"$dataset\",metric=\"$metric\",stat=\"pct_change\"}[30d]), \"cell\")",
     "legendFormat": "{{size}} \u00b7 {{load}}",
     "refId": "A",
     "range": false,
     "instant": true,
     "format": "time_series"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {},
     "unit": "percent",
     "decimals": 1,
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "#d95926"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "orientation": "horizontal",
    "displayMode": "basic",
    "showUnfilled": true,
    "valueMode": "color",
    "namePlacement": "left",
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "values": false
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Paired effect sizes, CIs, and Holm-adjusted p ($metric)",
   "description": "ratio, ci95 = paired-t 95% CI of the geometric-mean ratio; simci = Bonferroni-simultaneous CI for the family; delta = mean aead \u2212 plain (metric units).",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prom"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 12,
    "y": 3,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 9
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prom"
     },
     "expr": "last_over_time(bench_effect{dataset=~\"$dataset\",metric=\"$metric\"}[30d])",
     "legendFormat": "",
     "refId": "A",
     "range": false,
     "instant": true,
     "format": "time_series"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {},
     "decimals": 4
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "showHeader": true,
    "cellHeight": "sm"
   },
   "transformations": [
    {
     "id": "joinByLabels",
     "options": {
      "value": "stat",
      "join": [
       "cell",
       "size",
       "load"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "sortBy",
     "options": {
      "sort": [
       {
        "field": "cell"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "organize",
     "options": {
      "excludeByName": {
       "cell": true
      },
      "indexByName": {
       "size": 0,
       "load": 1,
       "n_blocks": 2,
       "ratio": 3,
       "ci95_lo": 4,
       "ci95_hi": 5,
       "pct_change": 6,
       "delta": 7,
       "p_t": 8,
       "p_holm": 9,
       "simci_lo": 10,
       "simci_hi": 11,
       "cliffs_delta": 12
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
